WEBVTT

00:00:00.587 --> 00:00:01.280
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.953
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> The news about the <b>bank</b> really surprised me.

00:00:06.955 --> 00:00:07.623
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.603
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> One <b>thing</b> I hate about supermarkets is queuing.

00:00:13.728 --> 00:00:14.494
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:18.269
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Please could you put the dirty dishes in the <b>sink</b>?

00:00:20.231 --> 00:00:20.964
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:21.925 --> 00:00:23.433
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I think you have a message.

00:00:23.785 --> 00:00:25.186
I just heard your phone <b>ping</b>.